er had six  children early in her career the working  mom struggled balancing home life and  career sometimes leaving them behind  when she went on tour I've given up a  lot but I've given a lot to and people  have given a lot to me I've raised my  head and set myself  but the country girl never forgot where  she came from never wanted to stop  creating the music she loved I don't  even know what retirement means I want  to die with a pencil in my handwriting  and it hit song a honky tonk song  [Music]

